      "content": "but the help doesn't change anything. it just resets the clock until the next time i fail. it's like i'm just waiting for the inevitable. it's so draining to keep fighting a battle you know you're gonna lose every single time. i just feel like i'm stuck in this loop and there's no real exit.",
